DESCRIPTION:HOTEL BRUNSWICK | THU 10 SEPT Yazmindi’s authentic sound and 
 evocative stories are a far-reaching crowd-favourite. A cornerstone of her
  musical prowess is her ability to craft authentic stories and evocative s
 oundscapes that build around her swelling harmonies. Yazmindi takes an hon
 est\, and sometimes tongue-in-cheek approach to authentically reflect on p
 owerful moments of love\, loss\, societal pressures\, youthful optimism\, 
 and determination. Traversing genres\, a common theme of empowerment\, esp
 ecially towards young women runs strong and true to Yazmindi’s core valu
 es. FREE ENTRY
